{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒ってないよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濃いメイクもすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はサンダル脱ぎ捨て隊の\n3人であるお仕事してきたよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんはなしたっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんと未央奈と私は\n去年の夏に3人で\nアンダーとして\n同じ景色をみてきて\n同じ思いを胸に抱えて\n同じフレーズを歌ってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今年の夏\n選抜メンバーとして\n表題曲の歌詞の同じフレーズを\n3人で歌ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも\nサンダル脱ぎ捨てた～\nって歌う前に2人が\n私の方に寄ってきてくれるのが\n嬉しくて嬉しくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう振り付けなんだけど\n最近は集まる時に3人で\n目を合わせてるんだ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月に入って3冊本を読むって言ったんだけど\nいま1冊目の半分まで読んでるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま読んでる本と\nもう1冊は決まってるけど\n3冊目はまだ決めてないから\nなに読もうかな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山登りしたい！\n井上さんと春に登る約束して\nできてないな～。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画もみたいのたくさんあるし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップとドックランにもいきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね、チップが\n日奈子の横にきてるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮ろうとしたら\n離れちゃった(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕方ないから\n前のやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い時期の！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではきょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/05/8736816/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}